23 years. Wait, but Ray's son was born when Raymond was 23. So if Samantha is 31 now, then how old is Raymond? Since Raymond was born 6 years before Samantha, Raymond is 31 + 6 = 37 years old. Then, Raymond's son was born when he was 23, so that would be 37 - 23 = 14 years ago. So the answer is 14. Let me confirm. Raymond is 37 now. Samantha is 31. Raymond was born 6 years before Samantha, so Raymond is 31 + 6 = 37. Correct. Raymond had a son when he was 23, so the son's birth year is 37 - 23 = 14 years ago. So the answer is 14. Therefore, the answer is 14. But why did I initially think 23? Maybe I confused the age of Raymond when he had the son with the current age. But the current age of Samantha is 31, so Raymond is 37. So 37 - 23 = 14. That's the answer.
