   $$
   \text{Raymond's age} = 31 + 6 = 37 \text{ years}
   $$

2. **Calculate how long ago Raymond's son was born**:  
   Raymond had his son when he was 23 years old. To find out how many years ago that was, we subtract his son's birth age (23) from his current age (37):  
   $$
   \text{Years ago} = 37 - 23 = 14
   $$

Thus, Raymond's son was born **14 years ago**.

$$
\boxed{14}
$$

